      "title": "Spooky Season Is Already Here—Shop the Best Halloween Collections of 2026",
      "link": "https://www.rd.com/article/halloween-collections-2026/",
      "published": "2026-08-13",
      "content": "每年，万圣节似乎都比往年更早到来。我们在6月下旬就发现了各大品牌官方万圣节系列产品，如今秋季已至，是时候拥抱这一季的惊悚魅力了。\n\n如果你对季节性装饰情有独钟，现在就是采购的时机，不要等那些精品消失。这里有混合式的院落装饰、万圣节主题的厨房用品、令人难以抗拒的节日布偶——以及更多令人惊喜的物品。我们从各大网络品牌中精选了最喜爱的产品。\n\n我们都熟知并喜爱乐福色（Le Creuset）的经典南瓜煮锅，但该品牌的秋季系列中还有更多诱人的万圣节购物清单。例如，可爱的迷你万圣节碗、蝙蝠杯等，这些产品都散发着秋季氛围，并带有一丝惊悚，价格也比全尺寸煮锅更亲民。\n\n仍然渴望经典南瓜的样式？看看新款南瓜服务碗。这个漂亮的碗可让你一直用到感恩节。\n\n年复一年，人类学（Anthropologie）证明万圣节可以既惊悚又优雅。我们特别喜欢石雕瓷器。我们的最爱是金色装饰的猫头鹰杯，甚至还得到了氢瓶（HydroJug）的改造，成为了一款40盎司的保温杯。\n\n你还可以用来自地形（Terrain）的新发现为你的前院增添一些惊悚的花园魔法，比如骷髅手南瓜支架和这款戏剧性的黑枝桂花圈。\n\n新旧万圣节茶布熊（Jellycat）最爱又回来了！提前庆祝惊悚季节，重温受欢迎的茶布熊南瓜灯和布克斯蝙蝠，以及新朋友如格劳斯顿石像鬼、幽灵鲍伯和魔法饮料。\n\n整个万圣节系列现已上市，但如果你有心仪的款式，最好不要等待太久。茶布熊粉丝出手极快。\n\n注意，我的德州房屋（My Texas House）粉丝们：该品牌的新万圣节系列已登陆沃尔玛（Walmart）。它带来了暗黑、沉闷的氛围，并带有一丝乡村魅力。\n\n紫色叶子花圈是一个简单的方式，可以让你的入口或壁炉台迎来惊悚季节的改造，而配套的花束则为你的餐桌增添了协调的点缀。我们还喜欢这款室内/室外黑色格纹层叠地毯和节日棉织南瓜毯子。\n\n如果新鲜花朵更符合你的风格，准备好为这些惊悚季节的花束着迷吧。来自鲜花（Bouqs）的“黑暗魔法”花束包含12、24或36支黑色染色玫瑰，非常适合喜欢暗黑和戏剧性的人。\n\n寻找更不哥特风的东西？这款白色秋水仙和风信子花束也带来了季节性的魅力，多亏了鬼魂般的白色花瓣和黑色中心。\n\nIKEA的新KUSTFYR系列证明，万圣节装饰不必花费大价钱。这个家庭友好的系列中充满了有趣、怀旧的发现，包括万圣节灯饰，如橙色南瓜灯和鬼魂灯串。\n\n我们特别喜欢这个户外南瓜吊灯，只需10美元。将这些黑色和橙色的灯用不同的高度悬挂，可打造出一个温暖、发光的展示，既有节日氛围，又不至于变成恐怖屋。\n\n如果你记得家居用品（Pottery Barn）过去几年曾推出过发光的门廊幽灵，也许会很高兴看到一些新朋友加入了阵容。这些发光的杰克灯幽灵将与“恐怖小队”桌布和配套餐巾一起亮相。\n\n当然，家居用品还带回了许多万圣节经典，包括节日季节枕头和手工制作的陶土杰克灯。这是我们喜爱家居用品万圣节的一切，加上几个新的小把戏和礼物。\n\n相似的氛围，但带有一丝更多的乡村厨房魅力，家具与吧台（Crate & Barrel）的万圣节系列中充满了温暖、舒适的家居用品。我们看中了这些闪烁的无火焰南瓜蜡烛和格纹和格纹有机棉厨房毛巾。\n\n如果想大手笔购物，我们还喜欢这个假小浆果花圈。这是一个简单的方式，可以为你的门口增添节日氛围，而不会牺牲色彩。\n\n错过了新出的莱诺克斯（Lenox）万圣节香料村套装？别担心。仍然有许多节日莱诺克斯发现，可以为你的晚宴增添一些惊悚魅力。\n\n这款复古屋幽灵捕捉了香料村的奇幻精神，而这款黑色点亮的莱诺克斯圣诞树小雕塑则为一个经典节日增添了令人愉快的惊悚感。\n\n我们通常会向巴尔森山（Balsam Hill）寻找一些最好的圣诞树，但该品牌也有一个出人意料的万圣节系列。这些可爱的万圣节毡饰品带来了手工制作的、工艺品般的感觉，而这些漂浮的发光巫师帽和蜡烛则为覆盖的门廊或门口投下了魔法般的光芒。别等了，这个系列的商品往往每年都会售罄。\n\n从大理石骷髅和钩针幽灵餐盘到节日壁画和户外女巫，TJ Maxx几乎提供了举办万圣节主题聚会所需的一切。\n\n最棒的是，你不必冒险进入拥挤的走廊或翻找无尽的货架来找到好东西。只需在线购物TJ Maxx万圣节，将你的惊悚发现直接添加到购物车中。\n\n好吧，我们可能找到了我们新的最爱万圣节毯子。这款来自步枪纸公司（Rifle Paper Co.）的编织幽灵毯子，完美地搭配在沙发上整个季节，并增加了一些万圣节魅力，而不会过分。实际上，这是我们最喜欢的装饰披肩，因为其精致的设计和100%的棉质构成。\n\n我们还沉迷于这个可爱的南瓜补丁蝴蝶结，由印花提花丝带制成，并附有鳄鱼夹。当然，步枪纸的瓷杯也很热门。看看这个大胆色彩的幽灵屋饮料杯。\n\n让你的孩子们的惊悚季节更加甜蜜，泥饼（Mud Pie）的珠子图案、有趣的印花和万圣节准备发现。从珠子万圣节桶或手绘纸浆糊桶开始，然后继续万圣节精神，带有荧光夜光睡衣和最可爱的节日婴儿服装。\n\n衣服、家居用品、配饰和装饰——科尔（Kohl's）可以是你万圣节的一切一站式购物中心。用幽灵花园支架装饰户外，然后带着怀旧的幽灵双人组将惊悚的光芒带入室内。\n\n别忘了孩子们。从万圣节玩具到适合装鬼篮子的节日书籍，这里适合每个人。\n\n在汉娜安德森（Hanna Andersson）找到万圣节睡衣、临时性装扮和每日穿搭。该品牌的万圣节系列让你为小孩子在舒适中度过这个季节变得轻松。\n\n新款玩具故事大衣睡衣为睡前带来了有趣的改变，而这些令人难以置信的可爱婴儿装扮帽子则渴望被拍照。\n\n乐高（LEGO）的万圣节系列非常令人印象深刻。重现《怪奇物语》、《暮光之城》和《哈利·波特》中的经典场景，或者保持经典，带有发光南瓜灯笼或黑色花束。\n\n无论你是为忠实粉丝购物还是为喜欢建造项目的人，这些惊悚套件都是适合所有年龄段的有趣季节性礼物。\n\n《读者文摘》首先发布了《惊悚季节已经到来——购买2026年最佳万圣节系列》一文。",
      "summary": "<p>Halloween seems to creep up earlier every year. We spotted official spooky-season collections from major brands as early as late June, but now that fall is upon us, it&rsquo;s <em>officially</em> time to embrace the haunt.</p><p>If seasonal decor is your weakness, consider this your sign to shop now before the good stuff vanishes. Find a mix of spooky yard decorations, Halloween-ready kitchen favorites, impossibly cute festive plushies&mdash;and more. We&rsquo;ve rounded up our favorite items from top brands all across the internet.</p><h2>Top Halloween collections in 2026</h2><div class=\"ap-card-wrap\"><div class=\"ap-card-image-wrapper\"><figure class=\"wp-caption\"><a class=\"ap-card-image-link\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lecreuset.com%2Ffeatured-collections%2Fharvest-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\" Signature Pumpkin Cocotte 01\" src=\"https://www.rd.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Signature-Pumpkin-Cocotte_01.jpg?w=680\" title=\" 1\" /></a><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">VIA MERCHANT</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ap-card-details\"><div class=\"ap-card-details-header\"><h3 class=\"ap-card-title\">Le Creuset</h3></div><div class=\"ap-card-details-footer\"><p class=\"ap-card-button-wrap  cta-affiliate-button retailer-primary\"><a class=\"bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-primary-color bumblebee-cta-size--lg ap-card-button bumblebee-cta-shop-at-le-creuset\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lecreuset.com%2Ffeatured-collections%2Fharvest-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Shop at Le Creuset</span></a></p></div></div></div><p>We all know and love <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lecreuset.com%2Ffeatured-collections%2Fharvest-collection\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Le Creuset&rsquo;s</a> iconic <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lecreuset.com%2Fsignature-pumpkin-cocotte%2F21238.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">pumpkin cocotte</a>, but the brand&rsquo;s harvest collection has plenty more to tempt your spooky-season shopping list. Think adorable <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lecreuset.com%2Fhalloween-mini-bowls-set-of-4-multicolor%2FST00311000S326001.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Halloween mini bowls</a>, <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lecreuset.com%2Fbat-mug%2F79005140000000.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">bat mugs</a> and more, all serving up autumn vibes with a sprinkle of spookiness&mdash;and at prices that are a bit more wallet-friendly than the full-size cocotte.</p><p>Still craving that classic pumpkin look? Peep the new <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lecreuset.com%2Fpumpkin-serving-bowl-4-qt%2F71777.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">pumpkin serving bowl</a>. This pretty piece will last you all the way through Thanksgiving.</p><div class=\"ap-card-wrap\"><div class=\"ap-card-image-wrapper\"><figure class=\"wp-caption\"><a class=\"ap-card-image-link\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.anthropologie.com%2Fanthrohome%2Fcollection-halloween-trend-shop\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Spooky Season Is Already Here Bistro Tile Stoneware Via Anthropologie.com 02\" src=\"https://www.rd.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Spooky-Season-Is-Already-Here_Bistro-Tile-Stoneware_Via-Anthropologie.com_02-1.jpg?w=680\" title=\" 2\" /></a><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">VIA MERCHANT</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ap-card-details\"><div class=\"ap-card-details-header\"><h3 class=\"ap-card-title\">Anthropologie</h3></div><div class=\"ap-card-details-footer\"><p class=\"ap-card-button-wrap  cta-affiliate-button retailer-primary\"><a class=\"bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-primary-color bumblebee-cta-size--lg ap-card-button bumblebee-cta-shop-at-anthropologie\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.anthropologie.com%2Fanthrohome%2Fcollection-halloween-trend-shop\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Shop at Anthropologie</span></a></p></div></div></div><p>Year after year, <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.anthropologie.com%2Fanthrohome%2Fcollection-halloween-trend-shop\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Anthropologie</a> proves that Halloween can be spooky and sophisticated. We&rsquo;re especially smitten with the bistro tiles stoneware. Our top pick is this gold-accented <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.anthropologie.com%2Fanthrohome%2Fshop%2Fbistro-tile-stoneware-24k-gold-accent-halloween-mug%3Fcolor%3D201%26type%3DSTANDARD%26size%3DOne%2BSize%26quantity%3D1\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">owl mug</a>, which has even gotten the <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.anthropologie.com%2Fanthrohome%2Fshop%2Fhydrojug-x-anthropologie-40-oz-traveler-water-bottle2%3Fcolor%3D218%26type%3DSTANDARD\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">HydroJug</a> treatment as a 40-ounce tumbler.</p><p>You can also give your front porch a little spooky garden magic with new finds from Terrain, like these <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.anthropologie.com%2Fanthrohome%2Fshop%2Fterrain-skeleton-hand-pumpkin-stake\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">skeleton hand pumpkin stakes</a> and this dramatic <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.anthropologie.com%2Fanthrohome%2Fshop%2Fterrain-cascading-black-boughs-wreath\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">black boughs wreath</a>.</p><div class=\"ap-card-wrap\"><div class=\"ap-card-image-wrapper\"><figure class=\"wp-caption\"><a class=\"ap-card-image-link\" href=\"https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=xhrwJRS6gEk&amp;mid=53609&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fus.jellycat.com%2Fcollections%2Fhalloween\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Jack O Lantern Courtesy Jellycat\" src=\"https://www.rd.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Jack-O-Lantern_Courtesy-Jellycat.jpg?w=680\" title=\" 3\" /></a><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">KATIE BANDURSKI FOR READER'S DIGEST</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ap-card-details\"><div class=\"ap-card-details-header\"><h3 class=\"ap-card-title\">Jellycat</h3></div><div class=\"ap-card-details-footer\"><p class=\"ap-card-button-wrap  cta-affiliate-button retailer-primary\"><a class=\"bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-primary-color bumblebee-cta-size--lg ap-card-button bumblebee-cta-shop-at-jellycat\" href=\"https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=xhrwJRS6gEk&amp;mid=53609&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fus.jellycat.com%2Fcollections%2Fhalloween\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Shop at Jellycat</span></a></p></div></div></div><p>New and old Halloween <a href=\"https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=xhrwJRS6gEk&amp;mid=53609&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fus.jellycat.com%2Fcollections%2Fhalloween\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Jellycat</a> favorites are creeping back in! Celebrate spooky season early with the return of beloved <a href=\"https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=xhrwJRS6gEk&amp;mid=53609&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fus.jellycat.com%2Fooky-jack-o-lantern%2F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Ooky Jack O Lantern</a> and <a href=\"https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=xhrwJRS6gEk&amp;mid=53609&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fus.jellycat.com%2Fbroox-bat%2F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Broox Bat</a>, plus new friends like <a href=\"https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=xhrwJRS6gEk&amp;mid=53609&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fus.jellycat.com%2Fgrowlston-gargoyle%2F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Growlston Gargoyle</a>, <a href=\"https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=xhrwJRS6gEk&amp;mid=53609&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fus.jellycat.com%2Fghost-bob%2F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Ghost Bob</a> and the <a href=\"https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=xhrwJRS6gEk&amp;mid=53609&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fus.jellycat.com%2Famuseables-vampop-drink%2F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Amuseables Vampop Drink</a>.</p><p>The <a href=\"https://www.rd.com/article/halloween-jellycats-2026/\">full Halloween line</a> is available now, but if you have your eye on a favorite, don&rsquo;t wait too long. Jellycat fans are famously quick to scoop up new drops.</p><div class=\"ap-card-wrap\"><div class=\"ap-card-image-wrapper\"><figure class=\"wp-caption\"><a class=\"ap-card-image-link\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fshop%2Fmy-texas-house-halloween-decor\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Texas House Layered Foliage Wreath\" src=\"https://www.rd.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Spooky-Season-Is-Already-Here_My-Texas-House-Layered-Foliage-Wreath_Via-Walmart.Com_04-1.jpg?w=680\" title=\" 4\" /></a><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">VIA MERCHANT</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ap-card-details\"><div class=\"ap-card-details-header\"><h3 class=\"ap-card-title\">My Texas House at Walmart</h3></div><div class=\"ap-card-details-footer\"><p class=\"ap-card-button-wrap  cta-affiliate-button retailer-primary\"><a class=\"bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-primary-color bumblebee-cta-size--lg ap-card-button bumblebee-cta-shop-at-walmart\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fshop%2Fmy-texas-house-halloween-decor\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Shop at Walmart</span></a></p></div></div></div><p>Attention, <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fshop%2Fmy-texas-house-halloween-decor\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">My Texas House</a> fans: The brand&rsquo;s new Halloween collection just landed at Walmart. It&rsquo;s bringing dark, moody vibes with a healthy dose of downhome charm.</p><p>The <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FMTH-PLUM-LEAF-WREATH%2F19712555955\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">plum foliage wreath</a> is an easy way to give your entryway or mantel a spooky-season makeover, while the <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FMTH-PLUM-LEAF-VASE%2F19581924673\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">matching arrangement</a> adds a coordinating touch to your table. We&rsquo;re also eyeing the indoor/outdoor <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FMy-Texas-House-Black-Plaid-Layering-Rug-24-x38%2F19680355575\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">black plaid layering rug</a> and festive cotton-knit <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FMy-Texas-House-50-x-60-Multicolor-Pumpkin-Throw%2F19908508984\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">pumpkin throw</a>.</p><div class=\"ap-card-wrap\"><div class=\"ap-card-image-wrapper\"><figure class=\"wp-caption\"><a class=\"ap-card-image-link\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fbouqs.com%2Fflowers%2Fhalloween\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Black Magic\" src=\"https://www.rd.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Spooky-Season-Is-Already-Here_Black-Magic_Via-Bouqs.Com_05.jpg?w=680\" title=\" 5\" /></a><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">VIA MERCHANT</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ap-card-details\"><div class=\"ap-card-details-header\"><h3 class=\"ap-card-title\">Bouqs</h3></div><div class=\"ap-card-details-footer\"><p class=\"ap-card-button-wrap  cta-affiliate-button retailer-primary\"><a class=\"bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-primary-color bumblebee-cta-size--lg ap-card-button bumblebee-cta-shop-at-bouqs\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fbouqs.com%2Fflowers%2Fhalloween\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Shop at Bouqs</span></a></p></div></div></div><p>If fresh flowers are more your speed, prepare to fall for these spooky-season stems. The <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fbouqs.com%2Fflowers%2Froses%2Fblack-rose-bouquet\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Black Magic</a> bouquet from <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fbouqs.com%2Fflowers%2Fhalloween\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Bouqs</a> features 12, 24 or 36 black-dyed roses, and it&rsquo;s perfect for anyone who loves dark and dramatic.</p><p>Looking for something a little less gothic? This <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fbouqs.com%2Fflowers%2Franunculus%2Fanemones-white-ranunculus\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">white ranunculus and anemone arrangement</a> brings its own seasonal charm, thanks to ghostly white petals and black centers.</p><div class=\"ap-card-wrap\"><div class=\"ap-card-image-wrapper\"><figure class=\"wp-caption\"><a class=\"ap-card-image-link\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ikea.com%2Fus%2Fen%2Fnew%2Fcelebrate-halloween-with-the-new-kustfyr-collection-pub073ced70%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Orange Pumpkin Lamp\" src=\"https://www.rd.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Spooky-Season-Is-Already-Here_orange-pumpkin-lamp_Via-Ikea.Com_06-1.jpg?w=680\" title=\" 6\" /></a><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">VIA MERCHANT</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ap-card-details\"><div class=\"ap-card-details-header\"><h3 class=\"ap-card-title\">IKEA</h3></div><div class=\"ap-card-details-footer\"><p class=\"ap-card-button-wrap  cta-affiliate-button retailer-primary\"><a class=\"bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-primary-color bumblebee-cta-size--lg ap-card-button bumblebee-cta-shop-at-ikea\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ikea.com%2Fus%2Fen%2Fnew%2Fcelebrate-halloween-with-the-new-kustfyr-collection-pub073ced70%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Shop at IKEA</span></a></p></div></div></div><p>Halloween decor doesn&rsquo;t have to cost a fortune with IKEA&rsquo;s new <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ikea.com%2Fus%2Fen%2Fnew%2Fcelebrate-halloween-with-the-new-kustfyr-collection-pub073ced70%2F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">KUSTFYR collection</a>. The family-friendly lineup is packed with playful, <a href=\"https://www.rd.com/list/vintage-halloween-photos/\">nostalgic</a> finds, including Halloween lighting like this <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ikea.com%2Fus%2Fen%2Fp%2Fkustfyr-led-table-lamp-pumpkin-orange-40638772%2F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">orange pumpkin lamp</a> and <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ikea.com%2Fus%2Fen%2Fp%2Fkustfyr-led-string-light-with-12-lights-battery-operated-indoor-ghost-white-50632557%2F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">ghost string lights</a>.</p><p>We&rsquo;re especially into this <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ikea.com%2Fus%2Fen%2Fp%2Fkustfyr-led-pendant-lamp-pumpkin-battery-operated-outdoor-orange-40632553%2F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">outdoor pumpkin pendant lamp</a>, and it&rsquo;s just $10. Hang a few of these <a href=\"https://www.rd.com/article/halloween-colors-black-and-orange/\">black and orange</a> lights at varying heights for a warm, glowing display that&rsquo;s festive without going full haunted house.</p><div class=\"ap-card-wrap\"><div class=\"ap-card-image-wrapper\"><figure class=\"wp-caption\"><a class=\"ap-card-image-link\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.potterybarn.com%2Fshop%2Fholiday-decor%2Fholiday-decor-halloween%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lit Jack O'lantern Ghosts\" src=\"https://www.rd.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Spooky-Season-Is-Already-Here_Lit-Jack-OLantern-Ghosts_Via-Potterybarn.Com_07-1.jpg?w=680\" title=\" 7\" /></a><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">VIA MERCHANT</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ap-card-details\"><div class=\"ap-card-details-header\"><h3 class=\"ap-card-title\">Pottery Barn</h3></div><div class=\"ap-card-details-footer\"><p class=\"ap-card-button-wrap  cta-affiliate-button retailer-primary\"><a class=\"bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-primary-color bumblebee-cta-size--lg ap-card-button bumblebee-cta-shop-at-pottery-barn\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.potterybarn.com%2Fshop%2Fholiday-decor%2Fholiday-decor-halloween%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Shop at Pottery Barn</span></a></p></div></div></div><p>If you remember <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.potterybarn.com%2Fshop%2Fholiday-decor%2Fholiday-decor-halloween%2F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Pottery Barn&rsquo;s</a> light-up porch ghosts from years past, you&rsquo;ll be happy to see some new friends joining the lineup. These lit <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.potterybarn.com%2Fproducts%2Flit-jack-o-lantern-ghosts%2F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">jack-o&rsquo;-lantern ghosts</a> are making their debut alongside the <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.potterybarn.com%2Fproducts%2Fscary-squad-runner%2F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Scary Squad table runner</a> and <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.potterybarn.com%2Fproducts%2Fscary-squad-napkins%2F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">matching napkins</a>.</p><p>And of course, Pottery Barn brought back plenty of Halloween classics, including festive <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.potterybarn.com%2Fproducts%2Fhalloween-hf-gtl-fa25%2F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">seasonal pillows</a> and <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.potterybarn.com%2Fproducts%2Fterra-cotta-jack-o-lanterns%2F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">handmade terracotta jack-o&rsquo;-lanterns</a>. It&rsquo;s everything we love about PB Halloween with a few new tricks and treats.</p><div class=\"ap-card-wrap\"><div class=\"ap-card-image-wrapper\"><figure class=\"wp-caption\"><a class=\"ap-card-image-link\" href=\"https://cratebarrel.pxf.io/DWaWqa\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Flicker Flameless Orange Pumpkin Led Candle\" src=\"https://www.rd.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Spooky-Season-Is-Already-Here_Flicker-Flameless-Orange-Pumpkin-LED-Candle_Via-Ctrateandbarrel.Com_07-1.jpg?w=680\" title=\" 8\" /></a><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">VIA MERCHANT</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ap-card-details\"><div class=\"ap-card-details-header\"><h3 class=\"ap-card-title\">Crate &amp; Barrel</h3></div><div class=\"ap-card-details-footer\"><p class=\"ap-card-button-wrap  cta-affiliate-button retailer-primary\"><a class=\"bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-primary-color bumblebee-cta-size--lg ap-card-button bumblebee-cta-shop-at-crate-barrel\" href=\"https://cratebarrel.pxf.io/DWaWqa\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Shop at Crate &amp; Barrel</span></a></p></div></div></div><p>Similar vibes, but with a little more rustic kitchen charm, <a href=\"https://cratebarrel.pxf.io/DWaWqa\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Crate &amp; Barrel&rsquo;s</a> Halloween collection is full of warm, cozy homewares. We&rsquo;re eyeing these flickering <a href=\"https://cratebarrel.pxf.io/6kDBxK\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">flameless pumpkin candles</a> and gingham-and-plaid <a href=\"https://cratebarrel.pxf.io/xJR0mA\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">organic cotton kitchen towels</a>.</p><p>For a bigger splurge, we also love this <a href=\"https://cratebarrel.pxf.io/VO0LRA\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">faux mini berry wreath</a>. It&rsquo;s an easy way to give your front door a festive refresh without sacrificing color.</p><div class=\"ap-card-wrap\"><div class=\"ap-card-image-wrapper\"><figure class=\"wp-caption\"><a class=\"ap-card-image-link\" href=\"https://lenox.pxf.io/JkQK62\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Vintage Halloween Lit House Figurine\" src=\"https://www.rd.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Vintage-Halloween-Lit-House-Figurine_Via-Lenox.Com_09.jpg?w=680\" title=\" 9\" /></a><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">VIA MERCHANT</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ap-card-details\"><div class=\"ap-card-details-header\"><h3 class=\"ap-card-title\">Lenox</h3></div><div class=\"ap-card-details-footer\"><p class=\"ap-card-button-wrap  cta-affiliate-button retailer-primary\"><a class=\"bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-primary-color bumblebee-cta-size--lg ap-card-button bumblebee-cta-shop-at-lenox\" href=\"https://lenox.pxf.io/JkQK62\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Shop at Lenox</span></a></p></div></div></div><p>Missed out on the new <a href=\"https://www.tasteofhome.com/article/lenox-halloween-spice-village/\">Lenox Halloween Spice Village Set</a> before it sold out? Don&rsquo;t worry. There are still plenty of festive <a href=\"https://lenox.pxf.io/JkQK62\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Lenox</a> finds to bring some spooky charm to your dinner parties.</p><p>This <a href=\"https://lenox.pxf.io/VOVxXj\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">vintage house haunt</a> channels the whimsical spirit of the beloved Spice Village, while this <a href=\"https://lenox.pxf.io/oNb4ME\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">black-lit take</a> on the iconic Lenox Christmas tree figurine puts a delightfully spooky spin on a holiday classic.</p><div class=\"ap-card-wrap\"><div class=\"ap-card-image-wrapper\"><figure class=\"wp-caption\"><a class=\"ap-card-image-link\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.balsamhill.com%2Fc%2Fhalloween-decor\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Trick Or Treat Halloween Felt Ornament Collection\" src=\"https://www.rd.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Trick-or-Treat-Halloween-Felt-Ornament-Collection_Via-Balsamhill.com_10.jpg?w=680\" title=\" 10\" /></a><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">VIA MERCHANT</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ap-card-details\"><div class=\"ap-card-details-header\"><h3 class=\"ap-card-title\">Balsam Hill</h3></div><div class=\"ap-card-details-footer\"><p class=\"ap-card-button-wrap  cta-affiliate-button retailer-primary\"><a class=\"bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-primary-color bumblebee-cta-size--lg ap-card-button bumblebee-cta-shop-at-balsam-hill\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.balsamhill.com%2Fc%2Fhalloween-decor\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Shop at Balsam Hill</span></a></p></div></div></div><p>We usually turn to <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.balsamhill.com%2Fc%2Fhalloween-decor\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Balsam Hill</a> for some of the <a href=\"https://www.tasteofhome.com/collection/balsam-hill-christmas-trees/\">best Christmas trees</a>, but the brand also has a surprisingly good Halloween collection. These adorable <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.balsamhill.com%2Ff%2Ftrick-or-treat-halloween-felt-ornament-collection%3Fsku%3D4107642\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Halloween felt ornaments</a> bring a handmade, crafty feel to your seasonal setup, while these floating <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.balsamhill.com%2Ff%2Flit-spellbound-wire-witch-hats%3Fsku%3D4004069\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">light-up witch hats</a> and <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.balsamhill.com%2Ff%2Foutdoor-spellbound-floating-candles%3Fsku%3D4101626\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">candles</a> cast a magical glow over a covered porch or doorway. Don&rsquo;t wait, items from this collection tend to sell out annually.</p><div class=\"ap-card-wrap\"><div class=\"ap-card-image-wrapper\"><figure clas