=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">wall art</a> and <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Ftjmaxx.tjx.com%2Fstore%2Fjump%2Fproduct%2Fhome-shop-by-category-halloween%2FOutdoor-Safe-Fabric-Led-Witches%2F1001012560\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">outdoor witches</a>, <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Ftjmaxx.tjx.com%2Fstore%2Fshop%2Fhome-shop-by-category-halloween%2F_%2FN-4017726405\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">TJ Maxx</a> has pretty much everything you need to host a Halloween-themed get-together.</p><p>The best part? You don&rsquo;t have to brave the packed aisles or dig through endless racks to find the good stuff. Just shop TJ Maxx Halloween online and add your spooky finds straight to your cart.</p><div class=\"ap-card-wrap\"><div class=\"ap-card-image-wrapper\"><figure class=\"wp-caption\"><a class=\"ap-card-image-link\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Friflepaperco.com%2Fcollections%2Fhalloween\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Porcelain Mug\" src=\"https://www.rd.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Porcelain-Mug_Via-Riflepaperco.Com_12.jpg?w=680\" title=\" 12\" /></a><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">VIA MERCHANT</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ap-card-details\"><div class=\"ap-card-details-header\"><h3 class=\"ap-card-title\">Rifle Paper Co.</h3></div><div class=\"ap-card-details-footer\"><p class=\"ap-card-button-wrap  cta-affiliate-button retailer-primary\"><a class=\"bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-primary-color bumblebee-cta-size--lg ap-card-button bumblebee-cta-shop-at-rifle-paper-co\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Friflepaperco.com%2Fcollections%2Fhalloween\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Shop at Rifle Paper Co.</span></a></p></div></div></div><p>Okay, we may have found our new favorite Halloween blanket. This <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Friflepaperco.com%2Fproducts%2Fwoven-blanket-ghosts\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">woven ghosts blanket</a> from <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Friflepaperco.com%2Fcollections%2Fhalloween\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Rifle Paper Co.</a> is perfect for draping over the couch all season long and adding a little Halloween charm without going overboard. In fact, it&rsquo;s our favorite decorative throw for its detailed design and 100% cotton composition.</p><p>We&rsquo;re also swooning over this adorable <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Friflepaperco.com%2Fproducts%2Fbow-clip-pumpkin-patch%3Fvariant%3D48001345323202\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">pumpkin patch bow</a>, made from printed jacquard ribbon with an attached alligator clip. And naturally, Rifle Paper&rsquo;s porcelain mugs bring the heat, too. Just look at this bold-hued <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Friflepaperco.com%2Fproducts%2Fporcelain-mug-haunted-house\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">haunted house sipper</a>.</p><div class=\"ap-card-wrap\"><div class=\"ap-card-image-wrapper\"><figure class=\"wp-caption\"><a class=\"ap-card-image-link\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.mudpie.com%2Fhalloween-shop\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Ghost Beaded Halloween Bucket\" src=\"https://www.rd.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Spooky-Season-Is-Already-Here_Ghost-Beaded-Halloween-Bucket_Via-Mudpie.Com_13-1.jpg?w=680\" title=\" 13\" /></a><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">VIA MERCHANT</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ap-card-details\"><div class=\"ap-card-details-header\"><h3 class=\"ap-card-title\">Mud Pie</h3></div><div class=\"ap-card-details-footer\"><p class=\"ap-card-button-wrap  cta-affiliate-button retailer-primary\"><a class=\"bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-primary-color bumblebee-cta-size--lg ap-card-button bumblebee-cta-shop-at-mud-pie\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.mudpie.com%2Fhalloween-shop\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Shop at Mud Pie</span></a></p></div></div></div><p>Make your little ones&rsquo; spooky season extra sweet with <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.mudpie.com%2Fhalloween-shop\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Mud Pie&rsquo;s</a> lineup of beaded patterns, playful prints and Halloween-ready finds. Start with <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.mudpie.com%2F42160004g-ghost-beaded-halloween-bucket\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">beaded Halloween buckets</a> or hand-painted <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.mudpie.com%2F40130223g-ghost-mini-treat-bucket\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">papier-m&acirc;ch&eacute; treat buckets</a>, then keep the Halloween spirit going with <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.mudpie.com%2F10860164-toddler-ghost-glow-pajama-set\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">glow-in-the-dark toddler pajamas</a> and the cutest <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.mudpie.com%2F10750049-halloween-tutu-baby-bodysuit\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">festive baby outfits</a>.</p><div class=\"ap-card-wrap\"><div class=\"ap-card-image-wrapper\"><figure class=\"wp-caption\"><a class=\"ap-card-image-link\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.kohls.com%2Fcatalog%2Fhalloween.jsp%3FCN%3DOccasion%3AHalloween\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Ghost Garden Stakes Set\" src=\"https://www.rd.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Spooky-Season-Is-Already-Here_Ghost-Garden-Stakes-Set_Via-Kohls.Com_14-1.jpg?w=680\" title=\" 14\" /></a><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">VIA MERCHANT</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ap-card-details\"><div class=\"ap-card-details-header\"><h3 class=\"ap-card-title\">Kohl&rsquo;s</h3></div><div class=\"ap-card-details-footer\"><p class=\"ap-card-button-wrap  cta-affiliate-button retailer-primary\"><a class=\"bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-primary-color bumblebee-cta-size--lg ap-card-button bumblebee-cta-shop-at-kohls\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.kohls.com%2Fcatalog%2Fhalloween.jsp%3FCN%3DOccasion%3AHalloween\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Shop at Kohl's</span></a></p></div></div></div><p>Clothes, housewares, accessories and decor&mdash;<a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.kohls.com%2Fcatalog%2Fhalloween.jsp%3FCN%3DOccasion%3AHalloween\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Kohl&rsquo;s</a> can be your one-stop shop for all things Halloween. Decorate outside with <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.kohls.com%2Fproduct%2Fprd-7627106%2Fstudio-66-casper-3-pc-ghost-garden-stakes-set.jsp\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">ghost garden stakes</a>, then bring the spooky glow indoors with this nostalgic <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.kohls.com%2Fproduct%2Fprd-8087418%2Fcelebrate-together-halloween-led-ghosts-decor.jsp\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">ghost duo</a>.</p><p>And don&rsquo;t forget the kiddos. From <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.kohls.com%2Fproduct%2Fprd-7439081%2Fkohls-cares-clifford-halloween-plush-toy-and-book-bundle.jsp\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Halloween toys</a> to <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.kohls.com%2Fproduct%2Fprd-8072064%2Flittle-blue-trucks-halloween-by-alice-schertle-childrens-board-book.jsp\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">festive books</a> perfect for a boo basket, there&rsquo;s a little something for everyone.</p><div class=\"ap-card-wrap\"><div class=\"ap-card-image-wrapper\"><figure class=\"wp-caption\"><a class=\"ap-card-image-link\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.hannaandersson.com%2Fcategory%2Fnew-occasion-halloween%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pixar Toy Story Costume\" src=\"https://www.rd.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Spooky-Season-Is-Already-Here_Pixar-Toy-Story-Costume_Via-Hannaananderson.Com_15-1.jpg?w=680\" title=\" 15\" /></a><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">VIA MERCHANT</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ap-card-details\"><div class=\"ap-card-details-header\"><h3 class=\"ap-card-title\">Hanna Andersson</h3></div><div class=\"ap-card-details-footer\"><p class=\"ap-card-button-wrap  cta-affiliate-button retailer-primary\"><a class=\"bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-primary-color bumblebee-cta-size--lg ap-card-button bumblebee-cta-shop-at-hanna-andersson\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.hannaandersson.com%2Fcategory%2Fnew-occasion-halloween%2F\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Shop at Hanna Andersson</span></a></p></div></div></div><p>Find Halloween pajamas, <a href=\"https://www.rd.com/list/last-minute-halloween-costumes/\">last-minute costumes</a> and everyday outfits at <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.hannaandersson.com%2Fcategory%2Fnew-occasion-halloween%2F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hanna Andersson</a>. The brand&rsquo;s Halloween collection makes it easy to dress little ones for the season in comfort.</p><p>New <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.hannaandersson.com%2Fpajamas-kids%2F84718-6KP.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Toy Story Costume HannaJams</a> bring a playful twist to bedtime, while these ridiculously cute <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.hannaandersson.com%2Fgirls-accessories-hats-gloves-mittens%2F83332-6XZ.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">baby costume hats</a> are begging for a photo op.</p><div class=\"ap-card-wrap\"><div class=\"ap-card-image-wrapper\"><figure class=\"wp-caption\"><a class=\"ap-card-image-link\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fhalloween%2Fhalloween-gifts\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Stranger Things The Creel House\" src=\"https://www.rd.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Stranger-Things-The-Creel-House_Via-Lego.Com_16.jpg?w=680\" title=\" 16\" /></a><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">VIA MERCHANT</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"ap-card-details\"><div class=\"ap-card-details-header\"><h3 class=\"ap-card-title\">LEGO</h3></div><div class=\"ap-card-details-footer\"><p class=\"ap-card-button-wrap  cta-affiliate-button retailer-primary\"><a class=\"bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-button bumblebee-cta-primary-color bumblebee-cta-size--lg ap-card-button bumblebee-cta-shop-at-lego\" href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fhalloween%2Fhalloween-gifts\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"btn-text\">Shop at LEGO</span></a></p></div></div></div><p><a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fhalloween%2Fhalloween-gifts\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">LEGO&rsquo;s</a> Halloween lineup is seriously impressive. Recreate iconic scenes from <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fproduct%2Fstranger-things-the-creel-house-11370\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Stranger Things</em></a>, <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fproduct%2Ftwilight-the-cullen-house-21354\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Twilight</em></a> and <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fproduct%2Fhogwarts-castle-and-grounds-76419\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Harry Potter</em></a>, or keep things classic with a light-up <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fproduct%2Fhalloween-pumpkin-lantern-40872\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">pumpkin lantern</a> or <a href=\"https://go.skimresources.com/?id=131817X1594237&amp;xs=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fproduct%2Fdark-flower-arrangement-11513\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">dark flower arrangement</a>.</p><p>Whether you&rsquo;re shopping for a die-hard fan or just someone who loves a good building project, these spooky sets make fun seasonal gifts for all ages.</p><p>The post <a href=\"https://www.rd.com/article/halloween-collections-2026/\">Spooky Season Is Already Here—Shop the Best Halloween Collections of 2026</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.rd.com\">Reader&#039;s Digest</a>.</p>",
